{"id":"wb-6-742","name":"曹溪寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"曹溪寺 (安宁市)","text":"曹溪寺是云南省安宁市的一座佛教寺院，主体建筑位于温泉街道以南1.5千米的葱山山麓，总占地面积2370平方米，内部建有山门、天王殿、正殿、后殿、钟鼓楼、廊屋、配殿等建筑。1983年1月，该寺院被公布为省级文物保护单位，2006年，其又被国务院公布为第六批国家级重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9B%B9%E6%BA%AA%E5%AF%BA_(%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%81%E5%B8%82)","revisionId":91288080,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91288080","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cb0f90877d24d20eaa18540e.jpg","title":"Caoxi_Temple,_Anning.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Caoxi_Temple,_Anning.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Caoxi_Temple%2C_Anning.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangmoon618","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​云南安宁曹溪寺","width":320,"height":213}}